# would not fit the queue's 90-minute window. It is an explicit list: the models
# whose measured time exceeds 40 minutes on a hosted runner (run 44626485250,
# 2026-11-19: Granite Rapids 50.8, Cannon Lake 46.7; the next, Granite Rapids
# 256VL, took 36.1). `matrix queue` is every other model, which the queue's
# hosted jobs run; `matrix all`, the weekly run, still runs every model hosted.
